**** Risks an Precautions

***** Data not compatible
in that case we need to see what options there are if any and start basically from scratch

***** Data adjustments needed
Depending on the nature of adjustments. If that would require changes on the function of ReOxy
or Noahlabs devices this will likely not be feasable and blow the Project scope.

If changes require a "post export" remodeling of the format or content of the exportet .txt files
we would have to check between aimediq bitmos and Noahlabs Software departments wether a solution
can be found. This would also mean we start from scratch

